    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start, thank you. Could you expand a bit on why the reaction feels so sudden and almost aggressive? I want to explain to the students why it doesn't just happen gradually as you peel it, but seems to \"attack\" the eyes almost instantly once the slicing begins.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
